  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operating Principles for Impact Management in Emerging Markets (GIIN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Operating Principles for Impact Management (OPIM) has emerged as a leading framework for investors to ensure impact is incorporated throughout the investment cycle. This grant will expand the outreach and programming of OPIM: increasing the participation of asset allocators as signatories to the framework and delivering the mobilisation of impact capital in EMDEs. This will include specific conference and stakeholder engagement activities, in addition to the development of OPIM guidance to promote best practice and lead to greater robustness, comparability and convergence of impact management practices.</narrative>
  </description>
